{"id": "dream-keeper-davis-spingola", "title": "Gifts, then grants: the Dream Keeper case against Sheryl Davis", "seconds": 144.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "29b708544c2ad071", "words": 412, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[12]"], "text": "In 2021, San Francisco’s Human Rights Commission took over Dream Keeper, a plan for Black communities.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.23, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Dream Keeper Initiative", "sub": "run by the Human Rights Commission from 2021, $60 million a year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 1.39, 1.6, 2.08, 2.3, 2.49, 2.88, 3.09, 3.31, 3.55, 4.25, 4.38, 4.62, 4.74, 4.95]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[12]"], "text": "Its director, Sheryl Davis, had run a nonprofit, Collective Impact, until 2016.", "t0": 6.23, "t1": 11.97, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Sheryl Davis", "sub": "HRC director from September 2016"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.22, 0.73, 1.06, 1.89, 2.04, 2.21, 2.27, 2.94, 3.39, 4.03, 4.29, 4.53]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[0]"], "text": "Prosecutors say she steered contracts to nonprofits paying for her podcast, book and travel.", "t0": 11.97, "t1": 17.49, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "13 contracts", "sub": "in which prosecutors say she had a personal interest"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.64, 0.83, 0.98, 1.28, 1.72, 1.84, 2.42, 2.66, 2.79, 2.91, 3.87, 4.37, 4.6]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[0]"], "text": "Worth how much?", "t0": 17.49, "t1": 18.52, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "13 contracts", "sub": "in which prosecutors say she had a personal interest"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.38]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]", "amount"], "text": "9,269,000 dollars.", "t0": 18.52, "t1": 20.55, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,269,000", "label": "in 13 contracts, alleged"}, "emph": ["9,269,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.28, 0.47, 0.66, 0.86, 1.12]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[4]", "notEstablished[0]", "established[20]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction. The San Francisco Standard reported she pleaded not guilty.", "t0": 20.55, "t1": 26.38, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "An allegation, not a conviction", "sub": "plea reported by the San Francisco Standard, April 2, 2026"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.56, 0.68, 0.77, 1.41, 1.57, 1.63, 2.92, 3.08, 3.25, 3.66, 4.01, 4.36, 4.51, 4.83, 4.99]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "That figure is contract value, not loss.", "t0": 26.38, "t1": 28.88, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$350,000", "label": "actually misused, the District Attorney said, as Mission Local reported", "sub": "the $9,269,000 is contract value, not loss"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.51, 0.61, 1.07, 1.4, 1.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Mission Local reported the District Attorney put actual misuse at about 350,000 dollars.", "t0": 28.88, "t1": 33.22, "shot": "b5x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$350,000", "label": "actually misused, the District Attorney said, as Mission Local reported", "sub": "the $9,269,000 is contract value, not loss"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.35, 0.66, 1.03, 1.12, 1.41, 1.7, 1.88, 2.21, 2.61, 2.74, 2.94, 3.16, 3.38, 3.63, 3.95]}, {"scene": "home", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[1]", "suspicious[3]", "established[13]"], "text": "James Spingola now ran it.", "t0": 33.44, "t1": 35.73, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Sheryl Davis", "sub": "HRC director"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "A shared home", "sub": "since 2015 (affidavit), since 2016 (Controller)"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "James Spingola", "sub": "led Collective Impact until October 2025"}], "kicker": "Undisclosed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 1.01, 1.24, 1.46]}, {"scene": "home", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[1]", "suspicious[3]", "established[13]"], "text": "The affidavit says he and Davis shared a home, two bank accounts and a car.", "t0": 35.73, "t1": 40.47, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Sheryl Davis", "sub": "HRC director"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "A shared home", "sub": "since 2015 (affidavit), since 2016 (Controller)"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "James Spingola", "sub": "led Collective Impact until October 2025"}], "kicker": "Undisclosed"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.74, 1.0, 1.17, 1.29, 1.61, 1.87, 1.94, 2.61, 2.81, 2.99, 3.33, 3.46, 3.53]}, {"scene": "home", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[8]", "suspicious[3].what", "established[9]"], "text": "She stayed a signer on the nonprofit’s bank account, and disclosed none of it, the Controller found.", "t0": 40.47, "t1": 45.55, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Sheryl Davis", "sub": "HRC director"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "A shared home", "sub": "since 2015 (affidavit), since 2016 (Controller)"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "James Spingola", "sub": "led Collective Impact until October 2025"}], "kicker": "Undisclosed"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.49, 0.57, 0.87, 0.96, 1.05, 1.57, 1.77, 2.4, 2.55, 2.98, 3.14, 3.21, 3.58, 3.71, 4.12]}, {"scene": "home", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[14]", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "In October 2022, she handed its grants to her deputy, citing only her old job there.", "t0": 45.55, "t1": 49.81, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "citing only that she used to run the nonprofit"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.55, 0.79, 1.27, 1.43, 1.7, 1.83, 2.14, 2.25, 2.34, 2.98, 3.29, 3.51, 3.63, 3.78, 4.02]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "Collective Impact paid 10,000 dollars toward guests on her personal podcast.", "t0": 50.03, "t1": 54.18, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Sunday Candy", "kicker": "Her personal podcast", "sub": "Collective Impact pays GPS Speakers", "chip": "$10,000"}, "emph": ["10,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.87, 1.15, 1.39, 1.72, 2.03, 2.26, 2.56, 2.69, 2.82, 3.17]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "timeline[5]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission dates that June 30, 2021.", "t0": 54.18, "t1": 58.44, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2021-06-30", "to": "2021-07-01", "days": "1", "fromLab": "podcast payment, per Ethics", "toLab": "Davis signs a grant", "kicker": "Her personal podcast"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.5, 1.25, 1.52, 1.69, 1.94, 2.59, 2.9]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "timeline[5]"], "text": "The next day, she signed it a grant. How much?", "t0": 58.44, "t1": 62.08, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2021-06-30", "to": "2021-07-01", "days": "1", "fromLab": "podcast payment, per Ethics", "toLab": "Davis signs a grant", "kicker": "Her personal podcast"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.41, 0.94, 1.11, 1.36, 1.43, 1.49, 2.59, 2.76]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[5]"], "text": "575,000 dollars.", "t0": 62.08, "t1": 64.16, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$575,000", "label": "HRC grant to Collective Impact, July 1, 2021"}, "emph": ["575,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.48, 0.95, 1.24]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "But the City Attorney dates that payment January 2022. The two records disagree.", "t0": 64.16, "t1": 68.87, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Ethics Commission", "June 30, 2021"], "b": ["City Attorney", "January 18, 2022"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.3, 0.55, 0.88, 1.09, 1.26, 1.55, 1.94, 2.16, 3.06, 3.19, 3.37, 3.69]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].why", "timeline[9]"], "text": "In 2022, it paid 2,000 more for the podcast, billed to a City youth grant.", "t0": 68.87, "t1": 73.99, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "June 24, 2022", "kicker": "More podcast money", "sub": "$2,000, billed to a youth-program grant", "chip": "$700,000"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.41, 1.3, 1.46, 1.69, 1.9, 2.22, 2.38, 2.48, 2.56, 3.55, 3.85, 3.96, 4.03, 4.26, 4.45]}, {"scene": "pod", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].why", "timeline[9]"], "text": "That June, Davis signed it 700,000 more.", "t0": 73.99, "t1": 76.63, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "June 24, 2022", "kicker": "More podcast money", "sub": "$2,000, billed to a youth-program grant", "chip": "$700,000"}, "emph": ["700,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.91, 1.21, 1.45, 1.58, 1.85, 2.06, 2.37]}, {"scene": "y23", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[6]"], "text": "In 2023, it paid for her book-launch singer, and a Martha’s Vineyard house in her name.", "t0": 76.85, "t1": 81.68, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Paid by Collective Impact, 2023", "rows": [["Conference sponsorships", "$49,999.99"], ["Martha’s Vineyard house", "$16,319.15"], ["Book-launch singer", "$5,000"], ["Flight upgrades", "$2,951.29"], ["Book booth", "$1,400"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 1.14, 1.31, 1.6, 1.73, 1.83, 2.24, 2.8, 2.96, 3.03, 3.35, 3.65, 3.87, 3.98, 4.13]}, {"scene": "y23", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "And 49,999.99 dollars of sponsorships.", "t0": 81.68, "t1": 86.78, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Paid by Collective Impact, 2023", "rows": [["Conference sponsorships", "$49,999.99"], ["Martha’s Vineyard house", "$16,319.15"], ["Book-launch singer", "$5,000"], ["Flight upgrades", "$2,951.29"], ["Book booth", "$1,400"]]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.73, 1.23, 1.43, 1.73, 2.11, 2.73, 2.96, 3.42, 3.7, 3.8]}, {"scene": "y23", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "A hearing officer found several were repaid from City youth and job grants.", "t0": 86.78, "t1": 90.43, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Paid by Collective Impact, 2023", "rows": [["Conference sponsorships", "$49,999.99"], ["Martha’s Vineyard house", "$16,319.15"], ["Book-launch singer", "$5,000"], ["Flight upgrades", "$2,951.29"], ["Book booth", "$1,400"]]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.47, 0.8, 1.0, 1.25, 1.38, 1.79, 1.96, 2.21, 2.46, 2.63, 2.87]}, {"scene": "y23", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission found probable cause of 39,107.21 dollars in gifts.", "t0": 90.43, "t1": 96.26, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$39,107.21", "label": "in gifts from Collective Impact, Ethics probable cause", "sub": "not a finding that violations occurred"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.48, 0.84, 1.07, 1.43, 1.78, 1.89, 2.29, 2.64, 2.76, 3.0, 3.23, 3.84, 4.05, 4.47, 4.76, 4.91]}, {"scene": "y23", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "That’s not yet a finding of a violation.", "t0": 96.26, "t1": 97.98, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$39,107.21", "label": "in gifts from Collective Impact, Ethics probable cause", "sub": "not a finding that violations occurred"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.28, 0.46, 0.65, 0.73, 1.03, 1.1, 1.16]}, {"scene": "bid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "timeline[3]"], "text": "Then a bid.", "t0": 98.2, "t1": 100.27, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Not Recommended", "kicker": "May 14, 2021", "sub": "the only bid, score 74.83"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.61]}, {"scene": "bid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "timeline[3]"], "text": "In May 2021, the workforce department marked Collective Impact’s proposal: Not Recommended.", "t0": 100.27, "t1": 106.0, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Not Recommended", "kicker": "May 14, 2021", "sub": "the only bid, score 74.83"}, "emph": ["Not Recommended"], "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.5, 0.77, 1.5, 1.64, 2.0, 2.39, 2.69, 3.15, 3.53, 4.33, 4.59]}, {"scene": "bid", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "Davis met an official there. A week later: recommended.", "t0": 106.0, "t1": 109.39, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["May 14", "Not Recommended"], "b": ["July 1, 2021", "$2,000,000 and $1,170,000"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.35, 0.5, 0.58, 0.94, 1.38, 1.49, 1.69, 2.15]}, {"scene": "bid", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "By July, contracts for 2 million and 1,170,000 dollars.", "t0": 109.39, "t1": 113.19, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["May 14", "Not Recommended"], "b": ["July 1, 2021", "$2,000,000 and $1,170,000"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.22, 0.84, 1.31, 1.44, 1.63, 2.07, 2.23, 2.47, 2.66, 2.9, 3.1, 3.38]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "established[1]", "established[19]"], "text": "She faces 13 felony conflict counts, plus misappropriation and perjury.", "t0": 113.41, "t1": 117.95, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The charges, March 30, 2026", "sub": "$6.17 million of the contracts are Collective Impact’s"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.56, 0.95, 1.28, 1.68, 2.3, 2.63, 3.41, 3.54]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "established[1]", "established[19]"], "text": "Spingola faces four counts of aiding.", "t0": 117.95, "t1": 120.5, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The charges, March 30, 2026", "sub": "$6.17 million of the contracts are Collective Impact’s"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.57, 0.9, 1.15, 1.41, 1.52]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "A City youth-department worker had flagged the payments back in May 2020.", "t0": 120.5, "t1": 124.62, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "May 2020", "sub": "a DCYF employee flags the payments"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.46, 1.09, 1.61, 1.78, 2.05, 2.14, 2.5, 2.7, 2.82, 3.03, 3.29]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["established[3]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Bribery wasn’t charged, and former Mayor London Breed isn’t implicated.", "t0": 124.62, "t1": 128.7, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That the gifts were bribes", "A court ruling on any count"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.52, 0.78, 1.46, 1.65, 1.96, 2.21, 2.5, 2.78, 2.99]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["established[7]", "established[16]", "next[1]"], "text": "A hearing officer refused to bar Collective Impact. The City Attorney appealed; no hearing or ruling yet.", "t0": 128.7, "t1": 135.21, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Criminal dockets 26007118 and 26007115"}, {"who": "", "what": "The City Attorney’s appeal, CPF25519491: no hearing or ruling by November 2026"}], "focus": 1}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.54, 0.95, 1.32, 1.41, 1.67, 2.06, 3.12, 3.29, 3.53, 3.83, 4.81, 5.02, 5.33, 5.45, 5.76]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["established[11]", "established[15]", "status"], "text": "Since August 2026, all three are suspended from City contracts. Hearings go on, with no trial date.", "t0": 135.21, "t1": 141.27, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.66, 0.89, 1.45, 1.69, 1.92, 2.02, 2.45, 2.61, 2.85, 4.02, 4.37, 4.56, 4.99, 5.21, 5.38, 5.67]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 141.27, "t1": 143.11, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.58, 0.7, 0.91, 0.99, 1.07, 1.29, 1.54]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The charge", "home": "The shared home", "pod": "T